          "en": "Sichuan–Shaanxi–Jialing River–Maogong"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红四方面军由川陕根据地西渡嘉陵江，经剑门关、江油、北川等地西进，与中央红军在懋功会师。",
          "en": "The Fourth Front Army crossed the Jialing River from the Sichuan–Shaanxi base, advanced west through Jianmen Pass, Jiangyou, and Beichuan, and met the Central Red Army at Maogong."
