        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "懋功—会宁（示意）"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红四方面军由懋功北上，经包座、腊子口进入甘南，占岷县、临潭、通渭，1936 年 10 月与会宁红一方面军会师；华家岭阻击战后结束本段。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "The Fourth Front Army moved north from Maogong via Bazuo and Lazikou into southern Gansu, occupied Minxian, Lintan, and Tongwei, and met the First Front Army at Huining in October 1936; the section ends after the Huajialing blocking battle. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
        },
