        "name": {
          "zh": "道孚—瞻化（四天翻越四座雪山）",
          "en": "Daofu–Zhanhua (four passes in four days)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红四方面军第四军第十师由道孚经麻孜、亚洛阔、沙拥、伊涅阿、拉日马、扎巴加奔袭瞻化（今新龙），四天连续翻越四座海拔 4000 米以上雪山。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "The 10th Division of the Fourth Front Army’s 4th Army rushed from Daofu via Mazi, Yalokuo, Shayong, Yijiea, Larima, and Zhabajia to Zhanhua (present-day Xinlong), crossing four passes above 4,000 m in four days. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
