        "name": {
          "zh": "哈达铺—成县—五龙山—徽县—两当—康县（成徽两康战役）",
          "en": "Hadapu–Chengxian–Wulongshan–Huixian–Liangdang–Kangxian (Cheng–Hui–Liang–Kang campaign)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红二方面军由哈达铺地区东出陇南，分三路攻占成县、徽县、两当、康县，并在成县五龙山阻击追敌。路线为示意，三路分进合为一条线。",
          "en": "The Second Front Army moved east from the Hadapu area into Longnan in three columns, taking Chengxian, Huixian, Liangdang, and Kangxian, and blocking the pursuers at Wulongshan in Chengxian. The route is schematic and combines the three columns into one line."
        },
